+                                // untouched. Deliberately NOT accepted:
+                                // UnaryOp (Neg/Not write flags), BinOp
+                                // (writes flags), GEP (scaled indices may
+                                // emit imul — writes flags), anything that
+                                // touches memory or the pending boolean.
